WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.700 --> 00:39.860
=Episode 4=

00:40.020 --> 00:42.620
(Shocking Court, Stunning Capital)

00:43.100 --> 00:43.540
What...

00:43.540 --> 00:44.420
What is this?

00:44.420 --> 00:45.620
I've never seen anything like it.

00:45.980 --> 00:47.100
Is it a gemstone?

00:47.340 --> 00:48.260
It's so beautiful.

00:48.900 --> 00:50.580
It must be worth a fortune.

00:54.580 --> 00:55.940
Is this a gemstone?

00:56.500 --> 00:58.260
How is it so crystal clear?

00:58.420 --> 01:00.460
Does this mean we've
succeeded in the firing?

01:01.460 --> 01:02.300
That's wonderful.

01:02.300 --> 01:03.300
That's wonderful, Hao.

01:03.300 --> 01:04.740
You won't be beheaded now.

01:04.740 --> 01:05.140
This is great.

01:05.140 --> 01:05.780
Aunt, what?

01:05.780 --> 01:06.620
What do you mean?

01:07.780 --> 01:08.580
It's nothing.

01:08.620 --> 01:09.300
It's nothing at all.

01:09.700 --> 01:11.180
Aunt, don't get so worked up.

01:11.220 --> 01:13.020
I'll show you something
that'll make you even happier.

01:14.380 --> 01:15.100
Hey,

01:15.220 --> 01:16.260
bring out two more pieces

01:16.260 --> 01:17.460
from the kiln there.

01:18.100 --> 01:18.780
Right away.

01:19.340 --> 01:20.540
Coming, Boss.

01:20.540 --> 01:21.220
What...

01:21.300 --> 01:22.220
What is this?

01:22.420 --> 01:23.300
Is it a vase?

01:23.660 --> 01:25.180
It's even prettier than ceramics.

01:26.860 --> 01:28.020
The luster is flowing

01:29.500 --> 01:30.820
like a dazzling galaxy.

01:32.340 --> 01:33.660
How can it be so beautiful?

01:43.380 --> 01:44.180
Not a single one

01:44.180 --> 01:45.900
of these is damaged.

01:46.500 --> 01:47.300
Hao,

01:47.380 --> 01:48.780
how did you do this?

01:48.820 --> 01:49.900
It's a piece of cake.

01:50.540 --> 01:51.020
Let's go.

01:53.940 --> 01:54.980
This...

01:54.980 --> 01:56.180
- It's truly beautiful.
- Yes, it is.

01:58.620 --> 01:59.420
I've never seen anything like it.

01:59.420 --> 02:00.220
Boss,

02:00.260 --> 02:01.020
why is this cup

02:01.020 --> 02:02.620
even brighter than the vase?

02:02.820 --> 02:03.740
These patterns

02:03.740 --> 02:04.940
look like they were painted on.

02:06.020 --> 02:07.020
Oh my.

02:07.420 --> 02:08.580
When the light hits it,

02:08.700 --> 02:10.540
the cup looks like
it's filled with water.

02:11.900 --> 02:14.180
Compared to this,
the porcelain cups we saw before

02:15.020 --> 02:17.220
are just clumps of dirt.

02:17.540 --> 02:18.740
- Exactly.
- Yes.

02:20.140 --> 02:20.980
Look at this one.

02:24.340 --> 02:25.300
This cup

02:25.700 --> 02:27.740
is as if it has trapped light inside it.

02:27.940 --> 02:29.100
From afar, it looks like mist.

02:29.180 --> 02:29.980
Up close,

02:30.300 --> 02:32.340
it feels like there are
gemstones embedded within.

02:33.020 --> 02:34.260
Exquisite, indeed.

02:35.620 --> 02:36.260
Alright.

02:36.260 --> 02:37.540
Later, load the rest from the kiln

02:37.540 --> 02:38.900
onto the cart and send them
to Juxian Restaurant.

02:39.460 --> 02:41.300
Leave these here
for my younger aunt to admire.

02:41.980 --> 02:43.020
Don't worry, Boss.

02:43.020 --> 02:43.780
Be careful.

02:43.900 --> 02:45.380
Use a straw to separate them all.

02:45.380 --> 02:46.220
Understood, Boss.

02:50.660 --> 02:52.540
The hotpot at
Juxian Restaurant is incredible.

02:52.540 --> 02:53.580
It's spicy enough,

02:53.780 --> 02:54.780
and the flavor is so fresh.

02:55.500 --> 02:58.300
The owner actually has
such clever ideas for food.

02:58.500 --> 03:00.180
No wonder business is booming.

03:00.500 --> 03:01.940
This makes money much faster

03:01.940 --> 03:03.700
than we peddling around the grasslands.

03:04.980 --> 03:05.660
Come.

03:05.660 --> 03:06.900
Take those boxes of glazed beads

03:07.060 --> 03:08.420
and put them in the most prominent spot.

03:08.540 --> 03:09.540
Then, spread a cloth over them

03:09.540 --> 03:10.260
to make them shine.

03:10.580 --> 03:11.100
Got it.

03:11.580 --> 03:12.940
Pauper?

03:13.060 --> 03:15.540
Do you know the owner
of Juxian Restaurant?

03:16.940 --> 03:17.660
Him?

03:17.900 --> 03:18.700
Yeah.

03:18.700 --> 03:19.980
According to what I've heard,

03:19.980 --> 03:23.140
although Wei Hao is a food talent,

03:23.180 --> 03:25.980
he is the most famous
person in the Great Yong Dynasty

03:27.100 --> 03:27.780
for being a fool.

03:28.700 --> 03:29.580
Is he more foolish than I am?

03:29.740 --> 03:31.260
Well, not quite that much.

03:31.660 --> 03:32.700
The customers here

03:32.700 --> 03:33.940
are all high-ranking officials.

03:33.940 --> 03:35.820
What they lack isn't money,

03:36.380 --> 03:37.860
but rare items.

03:39.740 --> 03:41.220
Come and see.
Look how crystal clear they are.

03:41.220 --> 03:41.740
So beautiful.

03:41.740 --> 03:42.540
So dazzling.

03:42.540 --> 03:43.340
Mister Wei,

03:43.420 --> 03:44.940
what kind of
rare treasure have you made?

03:45.940 --> 03:47.820
How does he have Beicang gemstones?

03:47.940 --> 03:48.780
And so many of them.

03:49.540 --> 03:50.580
Indeed, why are there so many?

03:50.580 --> 03:52.580
Today, I'm using this sand
to make gemstones

03:52.580 --> 03:54.380
so that none of your junk will sell.

03:54.820 --> 03:56.180
(He really made them.)

03:56.380 --> 03:57.100
Look at this.

03:57.100 --> 03:58.420
The red ones are like coral.

03:58.700 --> 04:00.060
The green ones are like jade.

04:00.740 --> 04:01.540
Under the sunlight,

04:01.740 --> 04:02.580
they even glow.

04:02.940 --> 04:03.980
The luster is dazzling.

04:03.980 --> 04:04.860
Could these be

04:05.020 --> 04:06.620
gemstones from Beicang?

04:07.020 --> 04:08.540
Look at this pale purple one.

04:08.740 --> 04:11.100
It's smoother than my madam's pearls.

04:11.740 --> 04:12.540
Mister Wei,

04:12.660 --> 04:14.260
how much are these gemstones?

04:14.740 --> 04:15.820
Don't be in a rush.

04:17.260 --> 04:20.020
Not only are these
gemstones unique and beautiful,

04:20.020 --> 04:22.740
but no one else in
the capital sells them.

04:23.140 --> 04:24.580
Most importantly,

04:24.620 --> 04:25.780
they are high-quality and affordable.

04:25.780 --> 04:28.100
Only one guan each.

04:28.420 --> 04:29.620
One guan?

04:29.620 --> 04:31.020
- One guan?
- What are you waiting for?

04:31.620 --> 04:33.140
Such an exquisite item

04:33.140 --> 04:34.380
for only one guan.

04:34.740 --> 04:36.620
Mister Wei, you didn't
miscalculate the price, did you?

04:36.620 --> 04:37.500
No mistake.

04:37.500 --> 04:38.380
That's the price.

04:38.580 --> 04:39.580
One guan?

04:41.580 --> 04:42.700
How is it you again?

04:43.100 --> 04:44.340
Gemstones like these in our grasslands

04:44.340 --> 04:45.340
sell for 15 guan.

04:45.340 --> 04:46.580
How can you sell them for one guan?

04:46.580 --> 04:47.060
I...

04:47.980 --> 04:49.860
I'll sell them for whatever I want.

04:49.860 --> 04:50.620
What's it to you?

04:50.620 --> 04:51.540
Exactly.

04:51.540 --> 04:53.060
If you're not buying, move aside.
Step back.

04:53.380 --> 04:54.060
Look.

04:54.060 --> 04:55.740
These are the real gemstones.

04:55.940 --> 04:57.300
His are all cheap goods.

04:57.340 --> 04:58.180
They're fake.

04:59.900 --> 05:01.980
I still think Mister Wei's are better.

05:02.260 --> 05:02.980
Indeed.

05:03.060 --> 05:04.260
Look at Mister Wei's.

05:04.420 --> 05:05.900
They are pure to the extreme.

05:05.940 --> 05:08.020
But if you look closely at this lady's,

05:08.020 --> 05:09.340
you will see impurities.

05:09.700 --> 05:10.580
Yeah.

05:10.620 --> 05:11.260
True.

05:11.260 --> 05:12.980
The people have a sharp eye.

05:13.540 --> 05:14.660
Well,

05:14.660 --> 05:16.060
you really don't seem too bright.

05:16.380 --> 05:16.980
Foolish.

05:17.900 --> 05:19.540
Mister Wei's gemstones are still better.

05:19.540 --> 05:20.340
They

05:20.780 --> 05:21.820
really are good.

05:22.740 --> 05:24.060
But because of that,

05:24.060 --> 05:25.260
you shouldn't sell them like this.

05:25.580 --> 05:27.420
My gemstones are worth 15 guan.

05:27.580 --> 05:29.100
How can you sell yours
for only one guan?

05:29.580 --> 05:30.460
True.

05:30.940 --> 05:32.260
My gemstone

05:32.540 --> 05:34.700
is worth at least 20 guan
at a glance, right?

05:34.700 --> 05:35.380
Right.

05:35.380 --> 05:36.260
However,

05:36.980 --> 05:38.340
I'm selling it for one guan.

05:38.340 --> 05:39.060
So what?

05:39.220 --> 05:39.580
I...

05:39.580 --> 05:40.260
Mister Wei.

05:40.660 --> 05:41.260
I was here first.

05:41.260 --> 05:41.980
I want these two boxes.

05:41.980 --> 05:42.860
I want some too. Me too.

05:43.260 --> 05:43.740
Me too.

05:43.740 --> 05:44.220
This one, right?

05:44.380 --> 05:44.940
Okay, okay.

05:44.940 --> 05:46.180
One guan. They're all one guan.

05:46.180 --> 05:47.060
I want some.

05:47.940 --> 05:49.300
I'll pay 200 guan.

05:49.300 --> 05:50.140
I'll take them all.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.740
I'm not selling to you.

05:51.740 --> 05:52.780
- Give me that green one.
- Get out of the way.

05:52.780 --> 05:53.540
I bought them all.

05:53.540 --> 05:54.460
Get away from me.

05:54.820 --> 05:55.580
Alright...

05:55.580 --> 05:56.500
Don't rush, everyone.

05:56.900 --> 05:57.980
Don't rush.

05:57.980 --> 05:59.940
(Juxian Restaurant)

05:59.940 --> 06:00.620
Grandfather,

06:00.900 --> 06:01.860
there are too many people.

06:01.860 --> 06:02.580
We'll have to line up.

06:02.580 --> 06:03.380
With so many people,

06:03.380 --> 06:04.860
(Fang Yizhi, Right Chancellor of the Great Yong)
I'll be late for the morning court.

06:07.140 --> 06:07.980
Young man.

06:08.020 --> 06:08.340
What is it?

06:08.340 --> 06:09.900
I want to buy those
gemstones in your hand.

06:09.900 --> 06:11.420
If you want to buy, go wait in line.

06:11.580 --> 06:12.940
I'll pay two guan per stone.

06:14.140 --> 06:15.020
Two guan?

06:15.100 --> 06:16.140
I didn't expect that in just a moment,

06:16.140 --> 06:17.060
a line would form.

06:17.060 --> 06:18.340
Two guan is certainly fine.

06:21.300 --> 06:22.100
Grandfather,

06:22.260 --> 06:23.060
aren't you buying anymore?

06:23.060 --> 06:24.140
You stay in line and buy them.

06:24.140 --> 06:25.100
I have an emergency.

06:25.100 --> 06:25.940
I'm going to the palace now.

06:25.940 --> 06:26.340
Hey...

06:27.940 --> 06:28.780
Eunuch Wang,

06:28.780 --> 06:30.060
go and urge Father.

06:30.060 --> 06:32.020
I have important
matters to attend to outside.

06:32.020 --> 06:32.780
Your Highness,

06:33.100 --> 06:34.420
when I went in just now to speak,

06:34.420 --> 06:35.780
His Majesty gave me a sharp glare.

06:39.540 --> 06:40.380
Minister Fang.

06:40.740 --> 06:42.220
I have urgent business with His Majesty.

06:42.660 --> 06:43.980
Minister Fang.

06:44.540 --> 06:45.340
Your Majesty.

06:48.580 --> 06:49.380
Your Majesty.

06:49.780 --> 06:50.700
Chancellor Fang,

06:50.780 --> 06:52.780
is there something urgent?

06:52.780 --> 06:53.540
Your Majesty,

06:55.700 --> 06:56.620
please take a look.

06:56.900 --> 06:59.060
I have just acquired some fine items,

06:59.300 --> 07:01.660
and I came specifically
to present them to you.

07:04.540 --> 07:06.540
See if these are not
of the highest quality.

07:06.540 --> 07:07.580
These gemstones...

07:08.540 --> 07:10.460
I have never seen such gemstones before.

07:10.540 --> 07:11.660
These are truly excellent.

07:12.020 --> 07:13.580
The quality is superb.

07:13.580 --> 07:14.020
Wait,

07:14.780 --> 07:16.420
aren't these gemstones from Beicang?

07:16.820 --> 07:17.380
My dear minister,

07:17.580 --> 07:18.820
where did you get these?

07:18.900 --> 07:19.820
Your Majesty,

07:19.980 --> 07:21.900
I found them at a shop in the East City.

07:21.900 --> 07:23.420
One guan apiece.

07:23.860 --> 07:25.300
The tribes of Beicang

07:25.300 --> 07:27.660
revere these as precious treasures,

07:27.660 --> 07:29.220
but according to the news I received,

07:29.580 --> 07:30.900
in that shop,

07:31.180 --> 07:32.780
gemstones of this quality

07:32.780 --> 07:34.740
are too many to count.

07:37.260 --> 07:39.460
These are much more exquisite

07:39.460 --> 07:40.860
than the ones Beicang sent as tribute.

07:42.180 --> 07:43.020
Boss.

07:43.900 --> 07:44.180
Any more?

07:44.180 --> 07:45.060
What is this?

07:45.060 --> 07:47.180
I heard Juxian Restaurant
is selling rare gemstones.

07:47.180 --> 07:48.340
Over here.

07:48.340 --> 07:49.140
Wrap this up for me.

07:51.580 --> 07:52.500
It's you?

07:52.940 --> 07:54.180
You're the one selling the gemstones?

07:54.340 --> 07:55.460
It's you?

07:56.620 --> 07:58.220
Move aside. Make way.

07:58.220 --> 07:59.100
Make way, everyone.

07:59.300 --> 07:59.700
Boss,

07:59.700 --> 08:00.700
where should I put the treasures?

08:00.700 --> 08:01.900
Put them all on the table.

08:02.380 --> 08:02.900
You got it.

08:09.180 --> 08:09.940
Look at that.

08:12.140 --> 08:13.140
So beautiful.

08:13.500 --> 08:14.860
These are the real treasures.

08:15.420 --> 08:16.620
What are these objects?

08:17.100 --> 08:18.300
Could that be a cup?

08:18.860 --> 08:20.100
Is that one a vase?

08:20.220 --> 08:21.660
The shapes are so stunning.

08:21.980 --> 08:23.420
Isn't this a liquor cup?

08:23.580 --> 08:25.660
These items are so beautiful
that they are dazzling.

08:29.780 --> 08:31.140
This glaze is blindingly bright.

08:31.260 --> 08:32.660
It looks like something
from the heavens.

08:33.060 --> 08:33.700
In all my years,

08:33.860 --> 08:35.580
I've never seen anything so transparent.

08:35.940 --> 08:37.300
Today is an eye-opener.

08:37.540 --> 08:38.460
Masterful craftsmanship.

08:38.460 --> 08:39.260
Simply masterful.

08:39.260 --> 08:41.620
These are just as
beautiful as the gemstones.

08:42.300 --> 08:44.180
They are even a hundred times better

08:44.180 --> 08:45.300
than the glazed cup in my hand.

08:45.740 --> 08:47.500
They are perfectly clear.

08:48.140 --> 08:51.060
You didn't make all of
these from gemstones, did you?

08:51.820 --> 08:52.660
What are you thinking?

08:52.820 --> 08:53.660
Am I crazy?

08:54.180 --> 08:54.940
Come, take a look.

08:58.220 --> 08:59.380
This is great stuff.

08:59.820 --> 09:00.660
Look at the transparency.

09:00.780 --> 09:02.380
It feels even clearer than glaze.

09:02.620 --> 09:04.460
Why does it feel so cool to the touch?

09:04.460 --> 09:06.100
It's an object I've never seen before.

09:06.340 --> 09:08.140
How much does this cost?

09:08.140 --> 09:09.500
I want to buy many of them.

09:09.660 --> 09:10.660
Twenty guan.

09:12.940 --> 09:13.980
Twenty guan?

09:13.980 --> 09:16.020
Such a beautiful cup for only 20 guan?

09:16.020 --> 09:17.060
If you buy more,

09:17.060 --> 09:18.140
I'll give you 20 percent off.

09:18.140 --> 09:19.620
Simply because I like the look of you.

09:19.700 --> 09:20.660
It's fate.

09:21.300 --> 09:21.860
It's only...

09:22.020 --> 09:23.140
It's only 16 guan?

09:24.980 --> 09:25.660
I want some too.

09:25.820 --> 09:27.620
That crappy cup of yours costs 60 guan.

09:27.820 --> 09:28.820
For you, it's 60 guan.

09:32.460 --> 09:33.540
You're so petty.

09:34.220 --> 09:35.100
You're right.

09:35.100 --> 09:36.300
I am petty.

09:36.580 --> 09:37.860
If you can't afford it, don't buy it.

09:37.860 --> 09:38.860
You pauper.

09:40.700 --> 09:42.020
Me, a pauper?

09:42.140 --> 09:42.620
I...

09:42.620 --> 09:43.340
Mister,

09:43.420 --> 09:44.940
I'd like to buy some as well.

09:44.980 --> 09:47.380
Could you give me
a 20 percent discount too?

09:47.460 --> 09:48.180
You?

09:48.860 --> 09:49.580
Original price.

09:50.460 --> 09:51.460
Don't be like that.

09:51.820 --> 09:52.860
I can buy a lot more.

09:52.940 --> 09:53.980
I don't like the look of you.

09:53.980 --> 09:54.780
Original price.

09:56.180 --> 09:57.180
In the past,

09:57.180 --> 09:58.980
any glazed object would sell

09:58.980 --> 10:00.700
for at least 60 guan.

10:00.700 --> 10:02.260
This is already
the lowest price in history.

10:02.260 --> 10:03.220
If you can't afford it, move aside.

10:03.220 --> 10:03.700
Exactly.

10:03.700 --> 10:05.340
If you can't afford it,
don't block the way.

10:05.540 --> 10:06.020
Move it.

10:06.020 --> 10:06.700
Go to the side.

10:06.860 --> 10:07.380
Right.

10:08.220 --> 10:09.020
This...

10:09.220 --> 10:10.660
A set of ten.

10:10.660 --> 10:12.180
The glaze color is the same as the cup.

10:12.180 --> 10:13.140
Drinking liquor with these

10:13.380 --> 10:14.700
is much more delightful.

10:14.860 --> 10:15.660
Take a look.

10:18.700 --> 10:20.060
How exquisite.

10:20.780 --> 10:21.140
How...

10:21.140 --> 10:22.260
How many more of these do you have?

10:22.260 --> 10:23.100
I want them all.

10:23.100 --> 10:24.220
As many as you want,

10:24.220 --> 10:25.220
that's how many I have.

10:25.420 --> 10:26.140
As many as I want?

10:26.140 --> 10:27.060
- What?
- What?

10:27.060 --> 10:28.340
Such fine glaze

10:28.340 --> 10:29.700
only appears once or twice a year.

10:29.740 --> 10:30.780
How could there be so many?

10:31.180 --> 10:31.980
Could

10:32.100 --> 10:33.660
Ning An have been right?

10:33.860 --> 10:34.740
It can be found

10:34.900 --> 10:36.260
everywhere in the Great Yong?

10:38.580 --> 10:39.260
Look at this.

10:39.540 --> 10:40.340
Cheng Chuchi.

10:40.820 --> 10:41.500
(Cheng Chuchi, Commander of the Imperial Guards)
I'm here, Your Majesty.

10:41.620 --> 10:43.060
Go to the shop now

10:43.060 --> 10:44.140
and invite the boss here.

10:44.140 --> 10:44.620
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:45.180 --> 10:46.620
There's as much as I want?

10:46.620 --> 10:46.980
Really?

10:47.300 --> 10:48.620
You aren't joking, are you?

10:48.660 --> 10:50.020
It's a craft I figured out myself,

10:50.020 --> 10:51.340
so the production can keep up.

10:51.460 --> 10:52.300
Just say it.

10:52.740 --> 10:54.340
How many do you want?

11:02.060 --> 11:04.900
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:05.500 --> 11:08.900
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:09.660 --> 11:12.620
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:12.980 --> 11:15.660
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:17.260 --> 11:20.740
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:20.740 --> 11:22.980
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:22.980 --> 11:25.060
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:25.060 --> 11:27.100
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:27.100 --> 11:31.460
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:32.900 --> 11:36.620
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:36.900 --> 11:40.500
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:40.660 --> 11:42.740
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:42.740 --> 11:47.540
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:47.740 --> 11:49.380
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:49.380 --> 11:51.700
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

11:51.780 --> 11:52.980
♪As the storm approaches♪

11:52.980 --> 11:55.380
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

11:55.580 --> 11:57.300
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

11:57.300 --> 11:59.260
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

11:59.460 --> 12:01.180
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:01.180 --> 12:03.300
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:03.300 --> 12:04.780
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:04.780 --> 12:06.980
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:07.220 --> 12:08.420
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:08.420 --> 12:10.940
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:11.060 --> 12:12.780
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:12.780 --> 12:14.060
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:14.220 --> 12:15.620
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:15.620 --> 12:16.660
♪To stay by your side♪

12:16.660 --> 12:18.580
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:18.740 --> 12:22.020
♪We are free and happy♪

12:26.020 --> 12:27.780
♪From a nobody♪

12:27.780 --> 12:29.700
♪To someone now famous♪

12:29.780 --> 12:31.220
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:31.220 --> 12:33.740
♪But I laugh at how they
cannot see through it all♪

12:33.820 --> 12:35.420
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:35.420 --> 12:37.500
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:37.700 --> 12:39.380
♪In this vast world♪

12:39.380 --> 12:41.380
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:41.540 --> 12:43.740
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:43.740 --> 12:45.340
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:45.420 --> 12:46.900
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:46.900 --> 12:49.300
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:49.300 --> 12:51.020
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:51.020 --> 12:52.180
♪Even if the falling snow♪

12:52.180 --> 12:53.820
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

12:53.820 --> 12:54.860
♪All I want now♪

12:54.860 --> 12:56.940
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

12:56.940 --> 13:00.220
♪Year after year♪
